      "predicate": "claim.map_note",
      "value": {
        "status": "open",
        "comments": 1,
        "latest": "Hi, after the South Barrett Reliever ribbon-cutting in April 2026, Greers Chapel Dr is now the road name from Barrett Lakes Blvd to Roberts Ct; this section is also now meadianed; the realigned intersection of Shiloh Valley Dr/Greers Chapel Dr is now signaled; Greers Chapel Dr north of Shiloh Valley Dr is now medianed and so is all of Roberts Ct.\n\nIf you'd like documentation of these notes, please feel free to message me.\n\nThank you for reviewing."
